<tr><td style="padding:13px 25px 7px"><div style="font:800 23px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114">今日 6 大重點</div><div style="font:12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#656A73;padding-top:3px">TOP KEY HIGHLIGHTS · 依行銷相關度排序</div></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #3F5BC8;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#3F5BC8">01 / 廣告平台 &amp; 行銷科技 · 影響生意</div><div style="font:800 18px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-21&amp;utm_content=highlight-1#microsoft-opens-creative-disclosures-bulk-a83652" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">Microsoft開放AI素材標示控制，可批次管理聲明</a></div><div style="font:13px/1.65 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#4B4D55;padding-top:9px">Microsoft Advertising宣布AI內容透明度控制正式可用，讓廣告主申報圖像及影片中的AI生成內容。</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">素材披露加入批次管理，廣告營運團隊可把生成來源與上架欄位連結，決定哪些資產需要更新聲明。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-21&amp;utm_content=highlight-1#microsoft-opens-creative-disclosures-bulk-a83652" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #3F5BC8;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#3F5BC8">02 / 廣告平台 &amp; 行銷科技 · 影響生意</div><div style="font:800 18px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-21&amp;utm_content=highlight-2#google-adds-gemini-agents-partner-806c9e" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">Google Cloud在合作夥伴行銷平台加入Gemini代理工具</a></div><div style="font:13px/1.65 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#4B4D55;padding-top:9px">Google Cloud公布Partner Marketing Studio更新，把Gemini工具加入合作夥伴的聯合行銷流程。</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">合作行銷團隊可把Google Cloud聯名規範放進素材製作階段，評估哪些渠道和語言版本可沿用同一工作流程。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-21&amp;utm_content=highlight-2#google-adds-gemini-agents-partner-806c9e" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #3F5BC8;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#3F5BC8">03 / 廣告平台 &amp; 行銷科技 · 可即用</div><div style="font:800 18px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-21&amp;utm_content=highlight-3#profound-brings-search-analysis-into-a83b95" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">Profound接入Teams，把AI搜尋分析帶進團隊對話</a></div><div style="font:13px/1.65 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#4B4D55;padding-top:9px">Profound推出Teams及Microsoft 365整合，讓團隊在對話中查詢品牌的AI搜尋能見度、準確度及引用份額。</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">AI搜尋問題可直接在協作對話中轉成分析工作，團隊可決定哪些能見度異常值得建立專案跟進。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-21&amp;utm_content=highlight-3#profound-brings-search-analysis-into-a83b95" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none"