49D7;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#6249D7">05 / 創意生產工具 · 可即用</div><div style="font:800 16px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-21&amp;utm_content=highlight-5#picsart-opens-platform-connecting-creative-6cc3dc" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">Picsart開放創意AI平台，統一接入生成與編輯模型</a></div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">把生成與修圖放在同一接入層，創意技術團隊可評估能否減少每次換模型時重做串接的工作。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-21&amp;utm_content=highlight-5#picsart-opens-platform-connecting-creative-6cc3dc" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #6249D7;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#6249D7">06 / 創意生產工具 · 可即用</div><div style="font:800 16px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-21&amp;utm_content=highlight-6#ideogram-4-6-adds-precise-74cdf3" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">Ideogram 4.6加入精確編輯API，可用遮罩限定修改範圍</a></div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">商品圖需要局部改背景或顏色時，團隊可評估遮罩編輯能否保留包裝文字和其他未指定區域。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-21&amp;utm_content=highlight-6#ideogram-4-6-adds-precise-74cdf3" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:23px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="background:#EBE8FF"><tr><td style="border-left:4px solid #5A42F4;padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">TEAM ACTION BOARD</div><div style="font:800 18px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding:7px 0 12px">今日可以跟進嘅方向</div><table role="presentation"><tr><td valign="top" style="font:800 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4;padding:0 9px 10px 0">01</td><td style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-bottom:10px">先抽查一批AI圖像及影片，把製作來源、素材聲明和實際版位的浮水印呈現逐項對照。</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" s